    "plain_text": "Sheikh Rashid bin Humaid Al Nuaimi is an Emirati businessman and a son of Ajman’s ruler. He founded R Holding, whose interests span property, hotels and education, and owns construction group Tech. A business administration graduate of the American University of Sharjah, he also chairs Ajman’s Municipality and Planning Department.",
